@startuml
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F8F8F8
  BorderColor #555555
}

state "Idle\nrunning = false\narmed = false" as Idle
state "Armed\nrunning = false\narmed = true" as Armed
state "Running\nrunning = true\nvalve, pump ON" as Running

[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Armed : 正常な START が離され\n正常な STOP が許可
Idle --> Idle : START 保持中、STOP 不許可、\nまたはいずれかの入力故障
Armed --> Running : 正常な START が押され\nSTOP が許可
Armed --> Idle : STOP 不許可\nまたはいずれかの入力故障
Running --> Running : STOP が許可\n(START 故障でも運転継続)
Running --> Idle : STOP 不許可\nまたは STOP 故障
@enduml
